OL,3,GNEWSAAutism training cafe appeals for
OL,4,Acustomers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe and bakery which trains people
OL,7,Fwith autism and ADHD could close due to
OL,8,Fa dramatic drop in footfall, bosses
OL,9,Fhave warned.
OL,11,FThe Glowsticks Project in
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough's Dundas Shopping Centre
OL,13,Fis providing 30 people with training
OL,14,Fand employment opportunities, charity
OL,15,Ffounder Rebecca Ibbotson said.
OL,17,FIt needs #5,000 a week to operate, but
OL,18,Fdaily takings have recently fallen to
OL,19,F#250, she said.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
