OL,3,GNEWSAAutism training cafe appeals for
OL,4,Acustomers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMia Oostdijch, 25, from Middlesbrough,
OL,7,Fwho has been part of the Glowsticks
OL,8,FProject for the last eight months, said
OL,9,Fit was "like a second family", adding:
OL,10,F"I love it here."
